WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:54.640 --> 00:02:00.180
<b>The Big Showdown
on the Judicial Island!</b>

3
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:13.930
[MARINE (OVER SNAIL)]
This is the main gate with
another urgent report, sir!

4
00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.770
[SPANDAM]
What is it this time?

5
00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:24.540
[MARINE]
There's a group of heavily armed men
riding giant monsters over the gate!

6
00:02:26.630 --> 00:02:28.730
[MARINE]
We need reinforcements!

7
00:02:30.510 --> 00:02:32.250
Please?

8
00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:34.560
Don't waste a second!

9
00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:36.320
[FAMILY MAN]
Let's go!

10
00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:41.560
Hello?

11
00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.800
What's wrong?

12
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:45.000
Answer me!

13
00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.970
What's going on here?

14
00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:58.750
[LUCCI]
Having second thoughts now?

15
00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:01.640
[LUCCI]
It's too late for that.

16
00:03:27.480 --> 00:03:29.580
[KOKORO]
All right guys, you ready to roll?

17
00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:32.720
Aren't you hurt?

18
00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:38.220
[SOGEKING]
Don't worry, these wounds
matter not...to Sniper King!

19
00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.100
[KOKORO]
Only four minutes left!

20
00:03:43.100 --> 00:03:47.270
Then the sea train, Rocketman,
is gonna tear through!

21
00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.160
<b>Main Gate</b>
<b>Island Gate</b>

22
00:03:56.790 --> 00:04:01.630
Sorry to bother you but
could you let me pass?

23
00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:04.700
[GATEKEEPERS]
Even if you ask nicely.

24
00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.410
You're still an intruder.

25
00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:10.600
And no means no!

26
00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.000
Fair enough.

27
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.370
But I'll warn you.

28
00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.340
Get ready for a fight.

29
00:04:18.340 --> 00:04:19.940
[GATEKEEPERS]
Bring it on, pirate!

30
00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:25.970
[LUFFY]
Gum-Gum...Ally Robot!

31
00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.640
[GATEKEEPERS]
Hey, that's cheating!

32
00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:36.900
[GATEKEEPERS]
How can we attack him?

33
00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.410
[GATEKEEPERS]
It's just a lame childish trick!

34
00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.040
Don't back down!

35
00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:45.620
[LUFFY]
Ally Robot...Punch!

36
00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:47.760
No!

37
00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:48.110
Ah!

38
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.540
[LUFFY]
Ally Robot Kick!

39
00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:55.180
[GATEKEEPERS]
I didn't mean to!

40
00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:57.670
I'm sorry!

41
00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:00.070
[GATEKEEPERS]
I've had enough of your games!

42
00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.940
[GATEKEEPERS]
Your back is wide open!

43
00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:13.890
[GATEKEEPERS]
Bastard!

44
00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:24.000
[GATEKEEPERS]
Bring him down!

45
00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:27.200
There's only one of him!

46
00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:51.150
[GATEKEEPERS]
Damn it.

47
00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.250
[GATEKEEPERS]
How does he do that?

48
00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:55.120
[LUFFY]
I'm in a hurry.

49
00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:58.350
But you'll have more
people to fight later!

50
00:05:58.350 --> 00:05:59.250
See ya!

51
00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:06.440
[GATEKEEPERS]
Hey!

52
00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.840
Come back!

53
00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:09.710
[GATEKEEPERS]
He went inside!

54
00:06:09.710 --> 00:06:10.410
After him!

55
00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.680
Quick!

56
00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.670
[GATEKEEPERS]
He made it to the main island!

57
00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:14.370
Right!

58
00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:15.810
I'm on it!

59
00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.080
[GATEKEEPERS (OVER SNAIL)]
This is the front gate, reporting!

60
00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:20.020
I'm afraid Straw Hat Luffy has
entered the main island, sir!

61
00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:20.850
[SPANDAM]
What?

62
00:06:20.850 --> 00:06:23.030
Why the hell did you let him do that?

63
00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.860
What's going on over there?

64
00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.000
What about Oimo and Kashii?

65
00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.970
You can't tell me
they got taken out, too!

66
00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:34.140
[GATEKEEPERS (OVER SNAIL)]
Well, it's actually the middle
of the night right now, sir.

67
00:06:34.140 --> 00:06:36.140
I'm thinking they're probably asleep.

68
00:06:36.140 --> 00:06:38.950
Then stop yapping at
me and wake them up!

69
00:06:38.950 --> 00:06:41.850
And if any of the other guards
are sleeping, wake them up, too!

70
00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:44.580
[GATEKEEPERS (OVER SNAIL)]
Yes, yes, sir!

71
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.780
[JABURA]
I don't get why everyone's
pissing their pants over this.

72
00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:50.480
What's one little intruder?

73
00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:54.080
Just let us take care of 'em.

74
00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:55.140
[SPANDAM]
Nonsense!

75
00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.620
This place is the entrance
to the World Government.

76
00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:01.590
The Judicial Island isn't just a Navy
base, it's a symbol of justice!

77
00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:04.830
[SPANDAM]
Any idiot should know what
it means to attack Enies Lobby

78
00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:07.030
and if they don't,
we'll have to teach them!

79
00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:09.660
If we let some dirty band
of pirates waltz in here

80
00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:14.010
and take their crewmember back,
what does that say about our forces?

81
00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:15.440
We have to beat them!

82
00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:17.110
Our pride is on the line!

83
00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:21.050
Those Straw Hats are going
to learn not to take us lightly.

84
00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.160
[SPANDAM]
Hey!

85
00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:22.860
Gatekeeper!

86
00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:25.340
What's going on at the main gate?

87
00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:27.580
Can you hear me, or what?

88
00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.980
How many enemies are
we looking at here?

89
00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.710
Where are they right now?

90
00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.940
[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]
I need answers, Main Gate!

91
00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.080
Did something happen?

92
00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:35.880
What's wrong?

93
00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:37.110
Hello?

94
00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:39.180
I can't help you if
you don't help me first!

95
00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:41.320
You didn't call me and
then hang up, did you?

96
00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.890
Are you listening?

97
00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.170
[PAULIE]
Rope Action!

98
00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:47.580
Figure Eight Knot!

99
00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.000
Bazooka Bat Strike!

100
00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:52.970
Heh heh!

101
00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:53.980
We're just starting!

102
00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:55.780
I can't go wasting my ammo!

103
00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.320
Go in through the doors on the side!

104
00:07:57.320 --> 00:07:59.120
Open that gate!

105
00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:05.170
[MARINE]
Push 'em back, before it's too late!

106
00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:06.900
[KIWI & MOZU]
You're in the way!

107
00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.440
[KIWI]
Mozu, take the left!

108
00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:09.770
[MOZU]
You got it!

109
00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:12.880
[MARINE]
You're not going anywhere!

110
00:08:14.710 --> 00:08:15.980
Is that a nose hair?

111
00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:17.910
Actually, it's a cowlick!

112
00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.180
Get moving!

113
00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:22.880
[KIWI]
Thanks!

114
00:08:22.880 --> 00:08:24.190
I owe you one!

115
00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:33.400
[TILESTONE]
My Keel Breaker!

116
00:08:39.470 --> 00:08:41.340
[FAMILY MAN]
Are you done?

117
00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:42.840
Mozu?

118
00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:44.440
Kiwi?

119
00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.910
[KIWI]
We tear ships apart.

120
00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:49.410
You can't expect a
little lock to slow us down!

121
00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:50.870
All right.

122
00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:52.140
My side is done!

123
00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.180
[MOZU]
Mine too!

124
00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.410
Good!

125
00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:56.180
[FAMILY MAN]
Let's open those gates!

126
00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.850
Herculean Destroyers go!

127
00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:07.160
[MARINE]
Don't let them open the gate!

128
00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:08.400
Fire!

129
00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:09.130
[FAMILY MAN]
Shut up!

130
00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.300
Move it!

131
00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.900
[FAMILY MAN]
All right men, let's go!

132
00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.350
[FAMILY MEN]
Whoa!

133
00:09:31.820 --> 00:09:34.820
[FAMILY MAN]
We made it through the main gate!

134
00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:41.230
What is that big hole?

135
00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:43.270
[FAMILY MAN]
We don't have time for that right now!

136
00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.270
Just ignore it!

137
00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.900
[FAMILY MAN]
Everyone make a dash for the next gate!

138
00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.500
[FAMILY MAN]
It's a waterfall!

139
00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:55.720
[KIWI & MOZU]
We did it!

140
00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.070
[ZAMBAI]
Guys over here!

141
00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.370
I got a plan.

142
00:09:58.370 --> 00:10:00.210
Could you lend me a hand?

143
00:10:07.670 --> 00:10:08.370
[GATEKEEPERS]
Kashii!

144
00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.270
Oimo!

145
00:10:09.270 --> 00:10:10.210
You have to get up!

146
00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:11.860
We need your help!

147
00:10:11.860 --> 00:10:15.460
The main gate was
forced open by intruders!

148
00:10:18.850 --> 00:10:22.160
[CASHY]
Hey Oimo, you hear that?

149
00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.770
He said the main gate's open.

150
00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.410
Oi!

151
00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.440
[OIMO]
I'm afraid that won't do.

152
00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.480
Right, Kashii?

153
00:10:32.510 --> 00:10:35.250
And I was sleeping so well, too.

154
00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.150
[CASHY]
Work is work.

155
00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.480
Let's go.

156
00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.670
[OIMO & CASHY]
Up and at 'em!

157
00:10:56.050 --> 00:11:05.980
<b>Oimo
Gatekeeper of
Enies Lobby's Island Gate Kashi
Gatekeeper of
Enies Lobby's Island Gate</b>

158
00:10:58.100 --> 00:11:00.140
[CASHY]
These pipsqueaks don't look like much.

159
00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:01.040
C'mon.

160
00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:03.140
You wanna get back to bed soon, right?

161
00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.920
Let's make this quick.

162
00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.120
[OIMO]
Sounds good.

163
00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:08.680
[FAMILY MAN]
Whoa, they, they're giants!

164
00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.050
Listen, twerps.

165
00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:13.530
I dunno what you think you're
doing here and I don't really care.

166
00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:16.430
Point is, you're getting
crushed if you get in our way.

167
00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:17.720
Right, Oimo?

168
00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:18.620
Oi.

169
00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:19.320
Right.

170
00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.290
You tell 'em, Kashii.

171
00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:24.540
One more step and we'll
pound your bones into paste.

172
00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:25.710
[FAMILY MAN]
Dude, this isn't fair!

173
00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:29.180
Nobody told me these guys
had giants for gatekeepers!

174
00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:30.260
[FAMILY MAN]
They're huge!

175
00:11:30.260 --> 00:11:34.550
They make our Herculean
Destroyers look like runts!

176
00:11:34.550 --> 00:11:35.420
Now, go home!

177
00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:38.220
There's no way I'm letting you through!

178
00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:40.250
Me neither!

179
00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:41.450
[FAMILY MAN]
Here they come!

180
00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:44.030
[FAMILY MAN]
The Franky Family ain't gonna
back down no matter what!

181
00:11:44.030 --> 00:11:45.800
Ain't that right, you guys?

182
00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.270
[FAMILY MAN]
Do it for Bro!

183
00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:55.450
All right, you know what that means.

184
00:11:55.450 --> 00:11:56.990
You bet.

185
00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:59.490
Let's do this!

186
00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:05.610
Those giants may be a lot bigger
than us but we're still pretty big!

187
00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:08.350
[FAMILY MAN]
We've torn apart ships
ten times their size!

188
00:12:08.350 --> 00:12:10.720
These freaks are nothing!

189
00:12:10.720 --> 00:12:12.550
[FAMILY MAN]
Go Destroyers!

190
00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:36.940
[FAMILY MAN]
No!

191
00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.640
Our Herculean Destroyers!

192
00:12:38.640 --> 00:12:42.280
[FAMILY MAN]
They... They got pounded!

193
00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.480
Don't you know?

194
00:12:43.480 --> 00:12:45.920
We have the blood of warriors
running through our veins!

195
00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.780
An overgrown human is still a human,

196
00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:51.560
but a giant of any size
is a fighter at heart!

197
00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:55.360
[CASHY]
By the pride of my people,
I won't let you pass!

198
00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.060
Oi!

199
00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:56.780
[OIMO]
Me too!

200
00:12:56.780 --> 00:12:59.410
[FAMILY MAN]
Don't uh... Don't get
cold feet, everyone!

201
00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.450
We can still do this!

202
00:13:01.450 --> 00:13:05.520
[FAMILY MAN]
That's right, our Big Bro is waiting
for us on the other side of that gate!

203
00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:09.540
[FAMILY MAN]
We'll show those monsters a
fight worthy of bro's name!

204
00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:11.540
Right, Franky Family?

205
00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.480
[OFFICIAL]
Hey, Straw Hat Luffy.

206
00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.020
How many friends did
you bring with you, huh?

207
00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:30.860
[MARINE]
We've got 10,000 soldiers
here at Enies Lobby!

208
00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:33.790
[LUFFY]
Sorry, but it's just me.

209
00:13:37.380 --> 00:13:38.920
[LUFFY]
Now get out of my way!

210
00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:51.290
[FAMILY MAN]
Our bro Franky wouldn't give up at
a time like this, and neither will we!

211
00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.930
[FAMILY MAN]
Don't give in!

212
00:13:57.930 --> 00:14:00.230
We gotta clear the way for Rocketman!

213
00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:08.940
[FAMILY MAN]
Bust down those doors!

214
00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:16.820
[OIMO]
Forget about it...I won't even
let an ant through this gate!

215
00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.620
[MOZU]
The Destroyers!

216
00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:26.150
What happened?

217
00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:27.250
You bastards.

218
00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:29.790
Took out our strongest guys
before I even got here!

219
00:14:29.790 --> 00:14:32.020
You'll pay!

220
00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:41.760
[CASHY]
What is that?

221
00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:42.910
[FAMILY MAN]
Zambai!

222
00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:43.600
Kiwi!

223
00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.300
Mozu!

224
00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.000
[FAMILY MAN]
Galley-La!

225
00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:50.620
[ZAMBAI]
Sorry we're late!

226
00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:55.830
Took a little longer than I thought
to get Sodom and Gomorrah ready for land!

227
00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:56.900
[FAMILY MAN]
Zambai!

228
00:14:56.900 --> 00:14:59.500
They beat the Destroyers!

229
00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.570
Yeah, I know.

230
00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:04.010
But we don't have time
to patch them up right now.

231
00:15:04.010 --> 00:15:06.780
The only thing that matters
is getting through that gate.

232
00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:10.930
We came here to rescue our big bro
and that's just what we're gonna do!

233
00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.660
Let's rock.

234
00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.530
Yeah!

235
00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:17.800
We'll send those
big lugs crashing down!

236
00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:18.730
[KIWI]
Come on!

237
00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.670
[MOZU]
You got it, Kiwi!

238
00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:29.810
Here we go!

239
00:15:29.810 --> 00:15:30.910
[KIWI & MOZU]
Hull Dismantler.

240
00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.880
Slash!

241
00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:36.680
[PAULIE]
Rope Action.

242
00:15:36.680 --> 00:15:38.710
Timber Hitch Tug!

243
00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:53.860
Kashii no!

244
00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:00.500
[LULU]
Tilestone!

245
00:16:14.730 --> 00:16:16.430
[LULU]
Treenail Lock!

246
00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:18.700
[TILESTONE]
It's a job well done!

247
00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:30.710
[OIMO]
Little runts!

248
00:16:31.700 --> 00:16:33.770
I'll crush you!

249
00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.840
Kashii!

250
00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.450
All right!

251
00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.080
How dare you.

252
00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.520
Don't let up, men!

253
00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:00.220
We got one more to go!

254
00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:02.060
[FAMILY MEN]
Yeah!

255
00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:11.110
[SPANDAM]
What's the current status?

256
00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:12.040
[OFFICIAL (OVER SNAIL)]
Sir.

257
00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:13.210
Well, Kashii and Oimo should be dealing

258
00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:16.580
with the intruders at the
main island gate right now.

259
00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.580
I don't suspect they're
having any trouble.

260
00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:19.850
Naturally.

261
00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.550
[SPANDAM]
But what about Straw Hat?

262
00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:23.120
Where are we at on that one?

263
00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:25.250
[OFFICIAL (OVER SNAIL)]
"Where are we at?" Ah.

264
00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:29.860
This is just an estimate,
but I'd say about four hundred?

265
00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.790
[SPANDAM]
Four Hundred?

266
00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:33.190
What're you talking about?

267
00:17:33.190 --> 00:17:35.330
[OFFICIAL (OVER SNAIL)]
Our casualties, sir!

268
00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:43.270
[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]
You're not making any sense, man!

269
00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:47.000
You're telling me Straw Hat
has defeated 400 of our guards?

270
00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:50.130
[OFFICIAL]
Looks like we lost about
a hundred more just now.

271
00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:51.330
No, that number's wrong.

272
00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:52.810
I'll correct it, sir.

273
00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:53.910
[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]
You'd better!

274
00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.850
Our guards are well-trained.

275
00:17:55.850 --> 00:17:58.700
I'll be damned if one man
could take that many out!

276
00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:02.640
If we have casualties,
at least report them properly!

277
00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:08.700
Right.

278
00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:10.600
Then allow me to report again.

279
00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:12.910
I'd estimate our current
casualties at five...

280
00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:17.990
[SPANDAM (OVER SNAIL)]
Five men?

281
00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.200
We've only lost five of our guards?

282
00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:21.560
[SPANDAM]
Jeez!

283
00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.990
How in the world could you
make such an obvious mistake!

284
00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:27.240
Five hundred.

285
00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.940
Seems Straw Hat's no threat after all.

286
00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:34.240
He's just running around the
island, making a lot of noise.

287
00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.740
Well, that's no surprise.

288
00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:39.410
Even he's not stupid enough to take
on that many guards on his own.

289
00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:42.910
Either way, it's only a matter
of time before he's captured.

290
00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:46.160
[OFFICIAL]
Good to see you all back.

291
00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:49.130
Chief, Mr. Lucci's party has arrived.

292
00:18:49.130 --> 00:18:50.530
[SPANDAM]
Excellent!

293
00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:51.970
Well, what are you waiting for?

294
00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:53.400
Show them in already.

295
00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:57.490
[NAMI]
By the way, Sniper King.

296
00:18:58.780 --> 00:19:00.350
[SOGEKING]
Hey!

297
00:19:01.300 --> 00:19:02.500
That hurt!

298
00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:06.270
[NAMI]
You think you could teach me how to use
the cold air feature on this thing?

299
00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:06.970
[SOGEKING]
Sure.

300
00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.240
It's simple...I mean.

301
00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.710
Why are you asking me?

302
00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:16.100
[KOKORO]
You ready, ladies and gents?

303
00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.300
The time has finally arrived.

304
00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.740
[KOKORO]
If they don't have those gates
open by now, it ain't gonna happen!

305
00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:24.580
[CHIMNEY]
Hurry up and go! Hurry up and go!

306
00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.780
[GONBE]
Meow!

307
00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:30.020
[KOKORO]
I'm gonna need you to take out
that iron fence, okay Samurai Man?

308
00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.680
[ZORO]
Just leave it to me.
